      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks. This change is based on b/485453627, where the existing hooks were identified as unintentionally exposing private dm-verity types in the stable ABI. The issue notes that Samsung is the only user of these hooks and that a coordinated one-time ABI break is needed to remove that exposure.\n\nFrom the Samsung side, we are coordinating the corresponding vendor implementation changes. I agree that the impact on any other partners should be confirmed before proceeding with the KABI break.",
